  "page_contents": [
    {
      "content": "End Assignment: {{profile.name}}",
      "created_at": "2026-08-27T17:44:43.207-04:00",
      "id": "4052db81-e947-4b8c-8ee4-32b983400b4f",
      "type": "SmallHeading",
      "uid": "b3_caaf55b3cb5546598d7db3ea8424063f",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-27T17:44:43.207-04:00"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>By ending this assignment, the end date will be set to today and the status will change from <b>Active</b> to <b>Terminated</b>. Also, if this is the only active assignment on this person's profile a termination event will occur.  Indicate if this person would be eligible to be rehired. If not, a reason must be provided and the person will be prevented from a future assignment.</p>",
      "created_at": "2026-08-27T17:44:43.247-04:00",
      "id": "32f7f6e7-2527-4b59-b0f7-a075c396daa0",
      "type": "HtmlContainer",
      "uid": "b3_7187f7ad6dde49ccbcaebfc81773febd",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-27T17:44:43.247-04:00"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p style=\"color:#856404;background-color:#fff3cd;border-color:#ffeeba;border-radius:5px;padding:.75rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:15px;\">Warning: This can have downstream impacts on {{attribute.assignment_person.first.first_name}}'s system access</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
      "created_at": "2026-08-27T17:44:43.289-04:00",
      "id": "9e0096f7-2952-4007-b813-605947969c6a",
      "type": "HtmlContainer",
      "uid": "b3_8d217f32a92f4169964232ab2dda554f",
      "updated_at": "2026-08-27T17:44:43.289-04:00"
    },
    {
      "content": "Click submit if you want to continue.",
      "created_at": "2026-08-27T17:44:43.333-04:00",
